  "body": "This unique property is nestled in the heart of Kohimarama, offering an exceptional lifestyle opportunity in one of Auckland’s most desirable suburbs, just metres from the beach. A top floor unit in a block of four, this home is designed for comfortable, easy living with light-filled interiors and great flow throughout, and features two generous bedrooms and two well-appointed bathrooms. The standout entertainer’s kitchen is beautifully finished with ample bench space and functionality, making it the perfect hub for hosting family and friends. Residents also enjoy access to a swimming pool within the complex — ideal for cooling off during the warmer months and embracing the relaxed coastal lifestyle Kohimarama is known for. A covered carport adds further convenience while a bus stop on your doorstep adds practicality. Whether you’re looking for a first home, to down-size or for a lock-up-and-leave investment this property delivers a multitude of options in a great location, mere moments form cafés, parks, waterfront walkways, and local amenities.",
